    "hypothesis": "A sampled four-bucket partition with per-worker counts and disjoint scatter should expose coarse, independent sort ranges to four OpenMP workers with fewer recursive partition stages than binary task quicksort; an introsort fallback and size cutoffs preserve performance and correctness on skewed or duplicate-heavy inputs.",
